{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scope X is a powerful yet lightweight tool that transforms your entire display into a precision zoom lens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Effortlessly toggle your zoom level, customize your focus ring, and fine-tune mouse sensitivity to suit your workflow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-Time Magnification</strong> \u2013 Instantly zoom in or out on any part of your screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Configurable Controls</strong> \u2013 Tailor keyboard and mouse shortcuts to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Focus Ring Customization</strong> \u2013 Adjust color, size, and opacity to keep your target in clear view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seamless Integration</strong> \u2013 Runs smoothly alongside other software, keeping your focus where it matters most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Safe to use</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Uses the same technology as OBS and the built-in Windows 10/11 magnifier to perform the zoom. No game hooks so no worries!\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477300?t=1742866557","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477300?t=1742866557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477300/1aef64386209f0594f592f3a605aa1f3f282b208/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742866557","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477300/1aef64386209f0594f592f3a605aa1f3f282b208/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742866557","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scope X is a powerful yet lightweight tool that transforms your entire display into a precision zoom lens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Effortlessly toggle you